# Admin + invite SPA routes render the app shell (login-gated / token-gated).
# NOTE: exact-path rules ("/admin /index.html 200") are DELIBERATELY absent:
# on this project they answered 308 instead of serving, and browsers cache
# a 308 permanently. Bare paths fall through to the same shell below via the
# platform's unknown-path fallback (verified live: /zzz → 200 shell), and the
# app itself routes bare /admin and /invite correctly.
/admin/* /index.html 200
/invite/* /index.html 200
